Normalization:
```
def norm(s):
    s = unicodedata.normalize('NFKD', s)
    s = s.lower()
    s = re.sub(r'\\[a-z]+', ' ', s)
    s = re.sub(r'[^a-z0-9]+', ' ', s)
    return ' '.join(s.split())
```
